# Build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
workspace/
Plans/

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# App runtime data (per-workspace run history, memory, inbox, approvals)
.enactive/
.aiclient/

# Files delivered into the chat by the Claude desktop app
Claude outputs/

# Scratch: probes and throwaway projects, kept out of the tree on purpose
work/

# Agent worktrees are separate checkouts; including them would duplicate the repository.
.claude/worktrees/

# Exported run logs dropped into a workspace by the log-reading tasks. The REPORT a run
# produced is worth keeping; the megabyte of log it was produced from is not.
Logs/*.log

# The wiki-audit run writes this every time, and it has to be ABSENT when the run
# starts - a step told to "start the report" must create it, not find it. Kept out of
# git so the tree is not dirty before every run and the run context does not say so.
# A pass worth keeping gets a dated name beside it, as Docs/DRIFT_wiki_2026-09-23.md is.
Docs/DRIFT_ollama.md

# Benchmark runs (tools/Enactive.Bench): each run's folder is local; the baseline it is compared with is kept.
bench/results/*
!bench/results/baseline.json
